r cart is empty\\\" - i.e. BOTH the now-sold item and the still-active Harry Potter book were wiped, not just the unavailable one. This indicates the cart is indiscriminately cleared on logout/login rather than being selectively filtered based on listing availability; no distinct feature was found that flags/removes only unavailable items while preserving valid cart items during a session.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-5\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Filled registration form and submitted. Redirected to home, toast \\\"Account created successfully!\\\" shown, header now shows logged-in user \\\"Timothee QA\\\" with Sell button.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-6\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Verified category filter (Furniture -> 3 items), condition filter (Fair -> 1 item: Kids Wooden Train Set), sort by \\\"Price: Low to High\\\" (list reordered ascending $35→$320), and the Price Range slider (dragging min updated displayed range \\\"$0-$500\\\" to \\\"$10-$500\\\" and re-filtered results). Category, condition, price range, and sort/distance controls all function as buyer filtering/sorting tools.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-7\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Typed \\\"Denim\\\" into the search box; results filtered from 10 items to 1 item, showing only \\\"Vintage Denim Jacket - Size M\\\", confirming keyword search works.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-8\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"On /product/prod-4, clicked \\\"Add to Cart\\\" (e3055). Header cart icon button changed from icon-only to \\\"1\\\" badge, confirming item was added to cart.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-9\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"On /cart with 1 item, clicked \\\"Send Purchase Request\\\" (e3108). Toast \\\"Purchase requests sent to sellers!\\\" appeared, and cart cleared to \\\"0 items\\\" / \\\"Your cart is empty\\\", confirming the purchase request was submitted successfully.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-10\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Attempted login with unregistered email nonexistent.user.xyz@example.com. App showed error toast \\\"Invalid credentials. Try: emma@example.com\\\" and did not log in.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-11\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Duplicate registration allowed\", \"actual\": \"Submitted registration form again with the exact same email (timothee.qa.test@example.com) already used for an existing account. The app accepted it and displayed \\\"Account created successfully!\\\" instead of rejecting the duplicate registration.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-12\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Login succeeds with incorrect password\", \"actual\": \"Logged in as demo account emma@example.com using a deliberately wrong password (\\\"definitely-wrong-password\\\"). App displayed \\\"Welcome back!\\\" and logged in successfully as Emma Green instead of rejecting the incorrect password. (Login page itself states \\\"Demo accounts... any password works\\\", confirming password is not validated.)\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-13\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Update feature does not exist, so the restriction cannot be verified\", \"actual\": \"Since no listing-update feature exists at all in the UI (only View/Mark Sold/Delete, and the guessed edit route 404s), it is impossible to verify that sellers are blocked from updating other sellers' listings; the underlying capability being restricted is entirely absent.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-14\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Submitted the Create Listing form with all fields empty. Form did not submit (remained on /create-listing, no success toast), and focus moved to the required Title field indicating browser-enforced required-field validation.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-15\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Filled the listing form with Price = -25 and all other required fields, then submitted. Form did not submit (remained on /create-listing, no success toast) and focus returned to the Price field, indicating the negative price was rejected by validation.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-16\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"No duplicate-account error feedback shown\", \"actual\": \"Re-registering with an already-used email produced the same \\\"Account created successfully!\\\" toast as a normal successful registration, with no error/warning indicating the account already exists.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-17\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Search results updated instantly to show \\\"1 items available\\\" as soon as \\\"Denim\\\" was typed into the search box, with no submit button or page reload required.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-18\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Toggling category checkbox (Furniture) and condition checkbox (Fair) immediately updated the \\\"N items available\\\" count and the visible product list without any submit action or page reload, confirming real-time filtering.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-19\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Immediately after clicking \\\"Add to Cart\\\", a toast notification \\\"Added to cart!\\\" appeared in the Notifications region, and the cart icon badge updated to \\\"1\\\" in the header, providing clear visual feedback.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-20\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Inspected img alt/src attributes for all 10 browse-page listings via DOM query. Each product has a unique, distinct Unsplash photo URL whose alt text matches its listing title, and each image is thematically appropriate to the described item (e.g., \\